    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "I’ve tried educational apps for quick explanations or step-by-step tutorials during study breaks. They’re useful for clarifying ideas, but I often get frustrated if they skip over intuition-building steps. My low extraversion and agreeableness mean I prefer human-like feedback over rigid algorithms.",
